config BR2_PACKAGE_K230_VGLITE
	bool "k230-vglite"
	help
	  libvg_lite.so, the user-space library of the K230's VGLite
	  2.5D GPU (/dev/vg_lite), built from the SDK's package/vg_lite
	  sources without its demos. The SDK's BR2_PACKAGE_VG_LITE
	  lists libdrm as a dependency, which Buildroot then builds and
	  installs whether or not it is enabled; the library itself
	  links only libm.
